# Keep build context small + prevent secret/artefact leakage into image layers.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/build
**/out
**/coverage
**/generated
.git
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
# never ship real env/secret files into an image layer (only *.example are safe, and unused in build)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example
recovery
packages/cre-workflow/secrets.yaml
packages/contracts/out
packages/contracts/cache
packages/contracts/broadcast
docs/plans
docs/runbooks
todos
